Kimi-Audio acoustic decoder attribution
=====================================

The code under detokenizer/ is adapted from Moonshot AI's Kimi-Audio:
https://github.com/MoonshotAI/Kimi-Audio/tree/349251e1d8f4f98d58fda59246381faecd7392e0/kimia_infer/models/detokenizer

The upstream README's License section and pyproject.toml identify this
non-Qwen code as MIT-licensed. At the revision above, the adapted Kimi files
do not contain an explicit copyright notice; no inferred copyright-holder
line is supplied here. Their original source references are retained.

TimestepEmbedder.timestep_embedding in detokenizer/flow_matching/model.py
also retains an upstream reference to OpenAI's GLIDE implementation:
https://github.com/openai/glide-text2im/blob/main/glide_text2im/nn.py
https://github.com/openai/glide-text2im/blob/main/LICENSE
